The Great Cabin~
This room is dominated by a large work bench covered with a great number of
magical apparatus bolted to the floor in the aft of the room.  On this side of
the room, you see a small table, a bunk and a bookshelf bolted to the floor.
Magic symbols cover the walls along with a few schorch marks where some spells
have taken a toll.  To the fore of the room is the doorway to the poop deck
and the room extends to the aft.
