#7910
In The Forecastle~
This room contains mostly canvas although the foreward mast rises from the
floor and travels up through the ceiling.  Wear and tear on the sails keeps
the pirates unlucky enough to have sail duty busy sewing and patching by the
light of the decklight grating above.  Along with this, barrels of tar and
other gear needed for repairs to the ship are lined against the walls.  To
the aft is the doorway to the main deck and there is a door to the port side
of the room.
~
