The Captain's Cabin~
The captain's cabin is incredibly decadent and filthy.  Most everything is
thrown around to lie where it fell.  Provacative paintings depicting scantily
clad women in various vunerable positions line the walls.  The captain
obviously enjoys travelling in order to sample the foreign brothels.  The
cabin extends to the starboard side.
~
