#7991
Kord's War Room~
You are standing in the room where Kord once planned out strategy in the days
when the Immortals took sides with the mortals. Those were the days when the
struggles that raged amongst the gods were fought by mortals and immortals
alike.  A large, mahogony table with matching chairs dominates the center of
the room like a hulking menace.  Maps of various sizes and places still sit in
the racks that line the walls in preparation for the next time the gods march
off to war.  At this time, Kord uses this room as a place to meet or simply be
alone and think where no distractions can intrude.
~
79 393276 0 0 0 0 255 0
D0
You see Kord's Spellroom to the north.
~
door~
