S
#7992
Kord's Spell Room~
You are standing in a very simple room.  No decorations adorn the walls at 
all.  The only thing preventing the walls of the room from being the same dull
gray all the way around is the various and intermittently spaced scorch marks.
These marks attest to the seething forces that can be summoned by the gods but
this room serves as more than just a place to vent angers and frustrations.
This is the room from which Kord creates.  Here is where he stands when he
reaches forth into the chaos and builds the worlds and inhabitants for which
he is so well known and respected.
~
